astp-docs — retrieval core for ASTP documentation servers
Scorched Earth Labs, LLC

Copyright 2026 Scorched Earth Labs, LLC.

This package is the corpus-agnostic retrieval library behind the ASTP
documentation servers: a structure-aware chunker for specification text, an
exact-lookup index over stable anchors, pluggable vector search, and the shared
tool logic the servers expose over their transports.

