SCOPE

This package contains no protocol text. It is a retrieval engine, and the
corpus it indexes is supplied by the server that consumes it. The ASTP
specification, its companion documents, and the notices that accompany them
live in the protocol repository:

    https://github.com/scorched-earth-labs/astp


